   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Ephemeral build pod\nImage: ai-hardened/ai-base (immutable tag)\nai-token: exchanges the ID token\nai-review: sends MR diff only, writes report\nNon-root, not privileged, no service account token\nNo user keys. No write credential.\nEgress only to GitLab, registry, STS, gateway, DNS",
   "originalText": "Ephemeral build pod\nImage: ai-hardened/ai-base (immutable tag)\nai-token: exchanges the ID token\nai-review: sends MR diff only, writes report\nNon-root, not privileged, no service account token\nNo user keys. No write credential.\nEgress only to GitLab, registry, STS, gateway, DNS",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "02-reference-architecture-25",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
